    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000c">Transcript-first editing</p>
					<h1 data-interaction-id="e0000d" class="e-ykrhga-e0000d-s e-heading-base">Edit the transcript. The audio follows.</h1>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000e">Delete a sentence and Gainstage removes it from every track, smooths the room tone across the join, and keeps your guest in sync. A 90-minute conversation becomes a finished episode in about 25 minutes.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000f-s " data-id="e0000f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000f">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000g"><a href="#start" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Edit your first episode free
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000h">No card. Two hours of audio a month, forever.</p>
		
</div>

