    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000l"><strong>[00:14:02]</strong> So the thing nobody tells you about launching a show</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000m">um, is that, you know, the editing is the actual job, right</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000n">is that the editing is the actual job. <strong>Every week.</strong></p>
		
</div>
