</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001k">The join is crossfaded against the room, not against silence.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001l-s " data-id="e0001l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001l">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001m">Sunday</p>
