<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00053 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00053-s " data-id="e00053" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00053" id="filler">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00054 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00054-s " data-id="e00054" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00054">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00055 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00055-s " data-id="e00055" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00055">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00056 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00056-s " data-id="e00056" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00056">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00057-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00057">02 — The sweep</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00058" class="e-ykrhga-e00058-s e-heading-base">Filler word sweep, with a before and after</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00059-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00059">One click removes 412 ums, 88 likes and 31 you knows, and you can hear each one before it goes.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005a-s " data-id="e0005a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005a">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005b">412 um</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005c">88 like</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005d">31 you know</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005e e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0005e-s " data-id="e0005e" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0005e">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005f-s " data-id="e0005f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005g-s " data-id="e0005g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005g">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005h">Raw recording</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005i">62:41</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005j"><strong>So um</strong>, the thing about doing this every week is, <strong>like</strong>, you sit down on Sunday and, <strong>you know</strong>, you think it's going to take an hour and, <strong>um</strong>, it never does.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005k-s " data-id="e0005k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005k">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005l-s " data-id="e0005l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005l">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005m">After the sweep</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005n">58:04</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005o">The thing about doing this every week is you sit down on Sunday and you think it's going to take an hour, and it never does.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005p">Every removal is a checkbox. Play it, keep it, or let it go — the same list, in the order you speak.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

