<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e000e4 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e000e4-s " data-id="e000e4" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e000e4">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e000e5-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e000e5">03 — The lock</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e000e6" class="e-ykrhga-e000e6-s e-heading-base">Multitrack sync for remote guests</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e000e7-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e000e7">Up to eight tracks stay locked together. Cut on the host track and the guest track cuts with it, drift-corrected across the whole file.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e000e8-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e000e8">Drop in the local recordings your guest uploaded after the call and Gainstage aligns them against the call backup, then throws the backup away.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

